      "finding": "unconditional_excluded","comment": "Clause 3.3 states a person is not fit for an unconditional licence if they have non-insulin treated diabetes and are treated with glucose-lowering agents other than insulin. Paragraph 1 confirms the patient injects insulin each evening, which excludes the 'diet and exercise alone' pathway (source_slot 1) and places him in the category requiring specialist review."
