      "finding": "conditional_qualified",
      "comment": "Clause 3.3 requires the specialist's opinion on whether criteria are met. Paragraph 1 states he cannot name the insulin preparation or dose; without this specific clinical data, the specialist cannot yet provide the required opinion to grant a conditional licence."
    }
